    "The server has no desktop, so pairtime samples no presence and records no focus: every slot's presence is unknown, and uncredited seconds take SM 5.2's codes for such a slot.",
    "Every prompt carries a message an agent sent through T3's MCP tools, which T3 stores with createdBy agent, so the T3 reader writes no relay record for it and rule 4 makes the prompt headless. headless_prompts counts them; relayed_prompts the prompts a relay record witnessed, none.",
